window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All it took was one look to end my life....</b></p> <p>Because one look is all it takes to trigger a werewolf's mate hunt.</p> <p>And when a wolf is hunting, he doesn't stop until his mate either dies or becomes a wolf too.</p> <p>Now I'm trapped in some guy's house, he's stuck in his wolf form, and there's no way out for either of us.</p> <p>Life as I knew it is over, but my fight to survive is only beginning.</p> <p><i>*This is a standalone new adult paranormal romance featuring sarcasm, humor, and slow-burn romance. Originally published on Kindle Vella, it's been edited and some chapters have been expanded.</i></p>"; 
